{"question_id": "8a2466db", "type": "single-session-preference", "label": true, "judge": "Yes.", "question": "Can you recommend some resources where I can learn more about video editing?", "gold": "The user would prefer responses that suggest resources specifically tailored to Adobe Premiere Pro, especially those that delve into its advanced settings. They might not prefer general video editing resources or resources related to other video editing software.", "hypothesis": "Okay, let\u2019s get you some resources for learning video editing! Here are some recommendations, broken down by type:\n\n**Online Courses & Tutorials:**\n\n*   **Adobe Learn:** (adobe.com/learn) - If you\u2019re using Premiere Pro, Adobe\u2019s own learning platform is fantastic. They offer free and paid courses covering everything from the basics to advanced techniques.\n*   **Skillshare:** (skillshare.com) - Offers a huge variety of video editing courses, often at affordable monthly rates.\n*   **YouTube Channels:**\n    *   **Peter McKinnon:** (youtube.com/@petermckinnon) - Great for creative editing techniques and inspiration.\n    *   **Premiere Gal:** (youtube.com/@PremiereGal) - Specifically focused on Premiere Pro tutorials.\n    *   **Justin Brown - Primal Video:** (youtube.com/@PrimalVideo) - Excellent for beginners and intermediate editors.\n\n**Web", "judge_model": "openai/gpt-4o-2024-08-06", "provider": "OpenAI"}
